{"2704930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "规则怪谈：盛崖小区", "steam_appid": 2704930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区在2024年2月份经过试开放后，收集了许多住户宝贵的意见。为此我们调整了游戏模式，并重置了盛崖小区内绝大多数的内容。同时，开放了小区内更多的区域，并引入了一系列的“便民服务”。也有更多的角色调整，有的人入住盛崖小区，有的人也会“融入”盛崖小区。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/08e9364d4d2fc92912abb14d524d30e4.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/08e9364d4d2fc92912abb14d524d30e4.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于盛崖小区</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >首先恭喜你，成为盛崖小区的新业主。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里有热情好客的邻居，有服务周到的物业，有尽职尽责的业主委员会。这里居住舒适，环境优美，房价低廉。最重要的是，这里非常安全。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但请注意，这里没有安宁中介。也不要相信……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/43db0372b7682f2db713fa2d3175e943.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/43db0372b7682f2db713fa2d3175e943.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于你身边的“人”</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >盛崖小区鼓励大家在小区内结交更多的朋友。我们致力于打造有温度的社区生活，多和你的邻居来往，说不定你们就会成为朋友，但也请不要过多窥伺他们的秘密。如果“静女”混在他们之中，你可以当做毫无察觉。这样你和他们都是安全的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不过你需要记住，不要与租户来往。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/7a1a1ddb3183248e7e56b4c045abbc89.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/7a1a1ddb3183248e7e56b4c045abbc89.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于小区内的规则</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >业主委员会负责制定小区内安全生活的“规则”，经由物业发放至每个业主手中。只要你遵守规则，你就可以安全地在盛崖小区内生活，而避免迷失其中。然而，请不要忘记，每一条“规则”的背后都是无数牺牲者的总结。它们可能并不准确，但它们足够真实，足够有血有肉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但有一条是永远准确的：规则之上，还有规则。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/50bf3f22dc8590352d8eeb9aa530ad4b.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/50bf3f22dc8590352d8eeb9aa530ad4b.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于公共区域</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从你的家中离开后，你会踏足到小区内的公共区域。包括楼道、电梯、连廊、物业前台、档案室等地点。一般来说，作为业主出入这些地方理应都是安全的。但也请不要掉以轻心，那些熟悉的地方总会带来陌生的恐惧感，或许你可以尽量去无视它们，如果你真的能做到的话……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果盛崖小区正处于潮湿期，那就请无视这段话吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/27881034977a376b24f9472155bc25b1.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/27881034977a376b24f9472155bc25b1.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>如果你喜欢这里，那就请关注《规则怪谈：盛崖小区》，将它加入你的<u>心愿单</u>吧！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区将于2024年10月24日盛大开盘。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>您也可以加入盛崖小区业主大群，来参加开盘前的各种活动，关注这里更多的动态。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区业主大群：</strong>193544429</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区业主二群：295746928</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请在盛崖小区快乐生活下去吧，不要探索，不要深究，不要质疑。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Eric Matyas </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区在2024年2月份经过试开放后，收集了许多住户宝贵的意见。为此我们调整了游戏模式，并重置了盛崖小区内绝大多数的内容。同时，开放了小区内更多的区域，并引入了一系列的“便民服务”。也有更多的角色调整，有的人入住盛崖小区，有的人也会“融入”盛崖小区。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/08e9364d4d2fc92912abb14d524d30e4.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/08e9364d4d2fc92912abb14d524d30e4.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于盛崖小区</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >首先恭喜你，成为盛崖小区的新业主。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里有热情好客的邻居，有服务周到的物业，有尽职尽责的业主委员会。这里居住舒适，环境优美，房价低廉。最重要的是，这里非常安全。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但请注意，这里没有安宁中介。也不要相信……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/43db0372b7682f2db713fa2d3175e943.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/43db0372b7682f2db713fa2d3175e943.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于你身边的“人”</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >盛崖小区鼓励大家在小区内结交更多的朋友。我们致力于打造有温度的社区生活，多和你的邻居来往，说不定你们就会成为朋友，但也请不要过多窥伺他们的秘密。如果“静女”混在他们之中，你可以当做毫无察觉。这样你和他们都是安全的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不过你需要记住，不要与租户来往。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/7a1a1ddb3183248e7e56b4c045abbc89.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/7a1a1ddb3183248e7e56b4c045abbc89.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于小区内的规则</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >业主委员会负责制定小区内安全生活的“规则”，经由物业发放至每个业主手中。只要你遵守规则，你就可以安全地在盛崖小区内生活，而避免迷失其中。然而，请不要忘记，每一条“规则”的背后都是无数牺牲者的总结。它们可能并不准确，但它们足够真实，足够有血有肉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但有一条是永远准确的：规则之上，还有规则。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/50bf3f22dc8590352d8eeb9aa530ad4b.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/50bf3f22dc8590352d8eeb9aa530ad4b.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关于公共区域</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从你的家中离开后，你会踏足到小区内的公共区域。包括楼道、电梯、连廊、物业前台、档案室等地点。一般来说，作为业主出入这些地方理应都是安全的。但也请不要掉以轻心，那些熟悉的地方总会带来陌生的恐惧感，或许你可以尽量去无视它们，如果你真的能做到的话……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果盛崖小区正处于潮湿期，那就请无视这段话吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras/27881034977a376b24f9472155bc25b1.avif?t=1760899047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/extras_big/27881034977a376b24f9472155bc25b1.avif?t=1760899047 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>如果你喜欢这里，那就请关注《规则怪谈：盛崖小区》，将它加入你的<u>心愿单</u>吧！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区将于2024年10月24日盛大开盘。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>您也可以加入盛崖小区业主大群，来参加开盘前的各种活动，关注这里更多的动态。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区业主大群：</strong>193544429</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>盛崖小区业主二群：295746928</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >请在盛崖小区快乐生活下去吧，不要探索，不要深究，不要质疑。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Eric Matyas </p>", "short_description": "这是一款怪谈类剧情游戏。在宏大的原创世界观下你需要一步步探索盛崖小区的“全貌”，你能做到仅仅是依靠“规则”在这里觅得一线生机。你可以假装无事发生，安然度日；也可以想尽办法，逃出生天；或许你也可以直面它，成为它的一部分……但无论如何，请你记住，保持理智，遵守规则。", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/header.jpg?t=1760899047", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/aa0d336e4c8be64ef5677b9511530a555495908a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760899047", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704930/aa0d336e4c8be64ef5677b9511530a555495908a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760899047", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11.0 compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11.0 compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ZHUYUAN Co.,Ltd"], "publishers": ["ZHUYUAN Co.,Ltd"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1099, "final": 1099, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$10.99"}, "packages": [968493], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy 规则怪谈：盛崖小区